/* ============================================================
   学园四季节日线（Wave E）—— 10 页
   季节标记：$mpFestSchoolSpring / Summer / Autumn / Winter
     0 = 未结算；1 / 2 / 3 = 该季走通的三种处理路线；4 = 该季失手
     非 0 即视为该季已了结；四季全部非 0 时 Finale 解锁
   当日防重结算：$daily.mpFestSchoolSpring / Summer / Autumn / Winter / Finale
   地点进度：$mpLocProgress_School（0–5）、$mpLocEvents_School
   终局：$mpWorldSchoolOutcome = "openarchive" / "curated"
   后续读取点：MP Loc School Hub、MP Loc School Deep、MP Loc School Ending A / Ending B
   ============================================================ */

:: MP Loc School Festival Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>>
布告栏最上沿那排铜钉今年换了新的，四张通知按季节依次钉开：春是浅灰的入学须知，夏是印着格线的考场守则，秋是油墨未干的摊位图，冬是白底黑框的典礼座次。
<br><br>
学园的一年就按这四张纸走。哪一季没办好，下一季就要多花力气去补；四张纸的顺序也不能乱，春天漏掉的名单，夏天会变成考场上的空座。布告栏下方还钉着一块窄木牌，你决定今年从哪一季接起。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[春·入学名册 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Spring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[夏·封卷日 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Summer]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[秋·礼堂搭台与布展 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Autumn]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<link [[冬·毕业筹备期 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Winter]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到学园的总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Spring [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>>
开学那天，校门只拉开一扇，转学生抱着行李站在门房窗下，手里攥着折了角的入学通知。门厅的布告栏刚换上新名单，浆糊没干，纸角在风里一下下拍着木板。
<br><br>
礼顿先生摆开名册，把最上面那叠纸往桌沿推了推：「转学材料有三份对不上，班级栏空着。你肯搭把手，就按报到顺序理一遍。」旁边等着盖章的家长排到走廊，孩子贴着墙根站。操场方向传来哨声，梅森带着新生绕跑道认路。
<br><br>
这一天的忙乱里藏着整学年最要紧的几件事：谁被分到哪个班，谁的材料缺一页。你决定从哪一头接手。
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[帮新生认路 (0:12)|MP Loc School Festival Spring After]]>><<pass 12>><<tiredness 1>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to 1>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[核验转学材料 (0:14)|MP Loc School Festival Spring After]]>><<pass 14>><<stress 1>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 270 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to 2>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[搬学生的行李箱 (0:10)|MP Loc School Festival Spring After]]>><<pass 10>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to 3>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回节历页 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Spring After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
门厅的人潮到上午十点才慢慢退下去。名册摊在长桌上，纸页被翻得起了毛边，红章在桌角留下一个半圆的印子。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSpring is 1>>
你把名单按报到顺序重排，先补齐空着的班级栏，再把走错楼层的新生带到各自的教室。改回来之后，队伍重新排好，礼顿先生接过名册，朝你点了点头。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSpring is 2>>
三份材料里有一份住址被改过两次，另一份监护人签名对不上。你把疑点逐条抄在便签上，附在名册后面。礼顿先生把那份材料抽出来，单独锁进抽屉。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSpring is 3>>
你把最重的两只箱子扛上三楼，来回走了四趟，肩窝硌出一道红印。新生的母亲塞给你一包饼干，你转手分给了走廊里等班级的孩子。
<<else>>
你抱着名册在门厅和教务处之间来回跑，名单却越理越乱。等你把最后一张纸排好，礼顿先生已经锁了门，只从门缝里说了一句明天再来。
<</if>>
<br><br>
放学铃响时，门口的队伍终于散了。值日生抱着纸箱出来收剩下的通知，箱底磕在台阶上，发出一声空响。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSpring and not $daily.mpFestSchoolSpring>>
<<set $daily.mpFestSchoolSpring to 1>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSpring is 1>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>>
<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSpring is 2>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 2>><<mpalertgain "校务处留意到你">>
<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSpring is 3>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.min(100, (($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + 1))>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.max(0, $mpLocProgress_School - 1)>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回节历总览 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[转入夏季考周 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Summer]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Summer [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>>
考周前一夜，教务处把试卷袋搬进礼顿先生的办公室。牛皮纸袋口贴着封条，红蜡上压着校徽，一摞摞码在长桌上。礼顿先生敲了敲桌面：「明天第一场开考，封条不能有口子。」说完把钥匙收进内袋。
<br><br>
第二天一早，整栋楼安静得反常。走廊上没有人跑，教室门一扇扇关着，窗玻璃上贴着考号。诺艾尔抱着实验器材出来，说实操考场还缺一套洗净的试管。梅森守在体育馆侧门，那里临时改成了大考场。
<br><br>
考周的规矩：封条、座次、钟点。真正要盯的却是人：有人把公式抄在袖口。你先处理哪一头，得自己拿主意。
<br><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[封存试卷 (0:12)|MP Loc School Festival Summer After]]>><<pass 12>><<tiredness 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to 1>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[巡考抓夹带 (0:14)|MP Loc School Festival Summer After]]>><<pass 14>><<stress 1>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to 2>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[陪病号去补考 (0:16)|MP Loc School Festival Summer After]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to 3>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[走回节历总览页 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Summer After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
最后一场考完，教室门一扇扇打开，走廊像退潮一样空下来。黑板上还留着监考写的交卷时刻，字迹被袖子蹭花了一半。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSummer is 1>>
你把每袋封条重新压了一遍，缺页的补上。有一袋的份数比登记少了一张，你最后在讲台抽屉的夹层里找到了那张草稿纸。礼顿先生把袋子锁好，肩膀松了一点。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSummer is 2>>
你在第三考场后门截住一个把纸条压在笔袋底下的学生，字迹和走廊里传的提纲对得上。你把人和纸条带到教务处，消息还是从走廊里漏了出去。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSummer is 3>>
医务室的床帘拉了一半，补考的学生脸色白得厉害。你把卷子摊在小桌上，按他的节奏一题题念。诺艾尔进来换了一次湿毛巾，没多说话。
<<else>>
你抱着一摞封好的袋子来回跑，越急越乱：有的袋口没压平，有的编号抄错了一位，等你回头核对，第一场已经开考。你站在走廊上，汗把衬衫粘在皮肤上。
<</if>>
<br><br>
收卷的钟敲过之后，整栋楼又恢复了平常的声响。考周结束了，成绩还要等几天才贴出来。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSummer and not $daily.mpFestSchoolSummer>>
<<set $daily.mpFestSchoolSummer to 1>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSummer is 1>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>>
<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSummer is 2>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -1>><<mpalert 3>><<mpalertgain "被记下的学生家长在打听">>
<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSummer is 3>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.min(100, (($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + 1))>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.max(0, $mpLocProgress_School - 1)>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回节历总览 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[转入秋季文祭 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Autumn]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Autumn [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>>
文化祭前一周，礼堂的门就没关严过。木工把布景板从后台拖出来，钉子撒了一地；戏剧社的学生蹲在台口对台词，念到后来声音都哑了。
<br><br>
傍晚，后台忽然少了一只木箱。箱子里装着铜制烛台和借来的旧戏服，原本放在幕布后面。礼堂后门的插销开着，门外小径上落着几片彩纸，被风推着往墙角走。
<br><br>
文祭只有一天，台要搭，摊要守，丢了的东西也得找。礼顿先生抱着一叠摊位许可过来，只说了一句「别让外面的人看笑话」。你先往哪边走，得自己拿主意。
<br><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[搭礼堂布景 (0:14)|MP Loc School Festival Autumn After]]>><<pass 14>><<tiredness 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to 1>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[守着社团摊位 (0:12)|MP Loc School Festival Autumn After]]>><<pass 12>><<tiredness 1>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to 2>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[追回丢失的道具 (0:12)|MP Loc School Festival Autumn After]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 1>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to 3>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回节历页 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Autumn After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
文祭散场时，礼堂地上铺了一层踩烂的彩纸，鞋底一沾就带得到处都是。台上只剩一盏顶灯亮着，照着还没拆完的布景。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolAutumn is 1>>
你踩着梯子把最后一块布景板固定住，钉子一根根敲进木框。台口的滑轮有些涩，你抹了点蜡，幕布拉了两遍终于不再卡住。开场时台下坐满了人，没有一个空位。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolAutumn is 2>>
你在摊位后站了一下午，收钱、找零、替人包干花，忙得连水都没喝。有个客人落了零钱，你追出去半条走廊才把人叫住。收摊时钱箱多出一截，诺艾尔把多出的推给你。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolAutumn is 3>>
你沿后门小径找到操场边，木箱被塞在体育器材间的帆布底下，烛台还在，戏服少了一件。你没有声张，先把箱子搬回后台，再找到那个抱着戏服的学生。
<<else>>
你在台口和后门之间来回跑，梯子没扶稳，布景板歪下来磕掉一角油漆；摊位那边又有人来换零钱，钱箱对不上数。开场铃响时，你站在后台的阴影里，膝盖发软。
<</if>>
<br><br>
天黑之后，礼堂的灯一盏盏灭下去，最后只剩门厅还亮着。文祭一年只有一次，剩下的活还得有人收尾。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolAutumn and not $daily.mpFestSchoolAutumn>>
<<set $daily.mpFestSchoolAutumn to 1>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolAutumn is 1>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<if ($money or 0) gte 15>><<money -15>><</if>><<stress -1>>
<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolAutumn is 2>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<money 45>><<stress -2>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolAutumn is 3>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -1>><<mpalert 3>><<mpalertgain "器材间被人翻动过">>
<<else>>
<<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.max(0, $mpLocProgress_School - 1)>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回节历总览 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[转入冬季毕业 (0:04)|MP Loc School Festival Winter]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Winter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>>
毕业季来得比往年早。第一场雪落在操场上时，礼堂的长桌已经摆开，毕业袍从仓库里搬出来，领口泛着旧年的黄。
<br><br>
礼顿先生把典礼流程单钉在门上，用红笔圈出几个名字，说这些人的座位要往前挪。诺艾尔在标本室腾出空桌，替毕业生缝补袍子；旧馆那边也忙着收回借出的卷宗。
<br><br>
典礼当天，家长会从校门一直排到礼堂门口。座位、袍子、卷宗，哪一样出了岔子，都会有人在台下看见。你在后台站了一会儿，决定先去做哪一件。
<br><br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[缝补毕业袍 (0:12)|MP Loc School Festival Winter After]]>><<pass 12>><<tiredness 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to 1>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[排出典礼座次 (0:12)|MP Loc School Festival Winter After]]>><<pass 12>><<tiredness 1>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to 2>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[清点旧日的卷宗 (0:14)|MP Loc School Festival Winter After]]>><<pass 14>><<stress 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280 or ($history or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to 3>><<else>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to 4>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回节历页 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Winter After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
典礼结束后，礼堂里的椅子还整排立着，靠背上搭着几条被忘掉的围巾。窗外的雪还在下，操场上的脚印一层压着一层。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolWinter is 1>>
你把最后一件毕业袍的袖口翻过来，沿着磨破的边重新压了一道线。来取袍子的女生在镜子前站了很久，小声问这样是不是看不出补过。你说看不出，她笑了一下，眼睛却红了。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolWinter is 2>>
你把座次表按班级重排，家长的位子单独留出来，靠走道的一列留给腿脚不便的人。开场前，礼顿先生沿着走道走了一遍，朝你抬了抬下巴，算是认可。
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolWinter is 3>>
你把推车上的卷宗按编号一箱箱对，缺页的记下来，乱序的重新排好。数到最后一箱时，登记册上多出一个编号，箱子里却没有对应的那本。你把清单抄了两份。
<<else>>
你在后台和走廊之间来回跑，针线缠成一团，座次表被咖啡泼湿一角。典礼开始前，你还在改最后一张椅子上的名字，笔尖把纸戳破了一个洞。
<</if>>
<br><br>
散场后，家长们三三两两往校门走。礼堂的灯还亮着，长桌上的流程单被风翻过一页。这一年的课算是上完了。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolWinter and not $daily.mpFestSchoolWinter>>
<<set $daily.mpFestSchoolWinter to 1>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolWinter is 1>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.trust to Math.min(100, (($mpNpcs.noel.trust or 0) + 1))>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolWinter is 2>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>>
<<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolWinter is 3>>
<<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School + 1)>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -1>><<mpalert 2>><<mpalertgain "旧馆的清单被人看见">>
<<else>>
<<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.max(0, $mpLocProgress_School - 1)>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSpring and $mpFestSchoolSummer and $mpFestSchoolAutumn and $mpFestSchoolWinter>><<mpritualicon>><<link [[毕业·收束全年 (0:06)|MP Loc School Festival Finale]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回节历总览 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Festival Finale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSpring to ($mpFestSchoolSpring or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolSummer to ($mpFestSchoolSummer or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolAutumn to ($mpFestSchoolAutumn or 0)>><<set $mpFestSchoolWinter to ($mpFestSchoolWinter or 0)>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
毕业典礼结束后，礼堂没有立刻清场。椅子还整排摆着，台口的灯只剩最后一盏，照在空讲台上。
<br><br>
这一年的事摆在眼前：开学的名册、考周封过的试卷袋、文祭失而复得的木箱、毕业袍上的白线。诺艾尔和梅森留在礼堂里。
<br><br>
<<set _good to 0>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSpring isnot 4>><<set _good += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSummer isnot 4>><<set _good += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolAutumn isnot 4>><<set _good += 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpFestSchoolWinter isnot 4>><<set _good += 1>><</if>>
<<if _good is 4>>四季都收得干净，走廊里有人经过时会朝你点头。<<elseif _good is 3>>四季里有一季留下了毛边，有人提起时，会先看你一眼。<<else>>四季里有几季没能接住，那些目光先落在你身上，又很快移开。<</if>>
<br><br>
旧馆的推车停在走廊尽头，箱子上贴着这一年的封条。是当着所有人的面把账翻开，还是照旧封好、交给学会的人带走，得由你开口。
<br><br>
<<if $mpFestSchoolSpring and $mpFestSchoolSummer and $mpFestSchoolAutumn and $mpFestSchoolWinter and not $daily.mpFestSchoolFinale>><div id="act-mp-loc-school-festival-finale">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "公开全年账 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<if !$mpWorldSchoolOutcome>><<set $mpWorldSchoolOutcome to "openarchive">><</if>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to 5>><<set $daily.mpFestSchoolFinale to 1>><<replace "#act-mp-loc-school-festival-finale">>
你把推车推到讲台前，当着还坐着的人把封条一根根剪开。卷宗按年份摊在长桌上，有人凑近看，有人站在后排不动。礼顿先生没有拦，只把章盒盖上，退到台侧。
<br><br>
那一晚阅览室的灯亮到很晚。往后查档不必再看谁的脸色，那些被压了多年的名字，终于能被人念出声。
<br><br>
<<stress -6>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:04)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去学园深层 (0:04)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "移交学会封存 (0:20)">><<pass 20>><<if !$mpWorldSchoolOutcome>><<set $mpWorldSchoolOutcome to "curated">><</if>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to 5>><<set $daily.mpFestSchoolFinale to 1>><<replace "#act-mp-loc-school-festival-finale">>
你把封条重新压平，在交接单上签了字。学会的人来得很快，木箱一只只抬上车。礼堂里的人陆续散了，礼顿先生收好交接单，朝你点了点头。
<br><br>
车开走后，门厅里只剩浆糊和旧纸的味道。规矩重新立了起来，知道内情的人彼此心照不宣。
<br><br>
<<stress -4>>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[回到学园总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[走进学园的深处 (0:04)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<<elseif $mpFestSchoolSpring and $mpFestSchoolSummer and $mpFestSchoolAutumn and $mpFestSchoolWinter>>
这一年的账已经当着人翻开过，礼堂里只剩收尾的活。你把流程单折好，塞进讲台抽屉。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去学园深层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
四季的账还压在各自的抽屉里，礼堂的门不该在这一刻打开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回节历总览 (0:02)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回学园去 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>
